					"expectedAnswer": "(x{{eval:-h;+}})^2{{eval:k;+}}"
				}
			],
			"statement": "Détermine la forme canonique du polynôme $P(x)={{eval:ax^2+bx+c}}$.\n\n$P(x)=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "x|x"
				},
				{
					"name": "h",
					"expression": "1..5;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "1..9;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "eval:-2*h"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "eval:h^2+k"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["c != 0"],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On complète le carré : $(x{{eval:-h;+}})^2={{eval:x^2-2*h*x+h^2}}$, donc ${{eval:x^2+b*x}}=(x{{eval:-h;+}})^2-{{eval:h^2}}$.",
					"$$\\begin{align}P(x) &= (x{{eval:-h;+}})^2-{{eval:h^2}}{{eval:c;+}} \\\\ &= (x{{eval:-h;+}})^2{{eval:k;+}}\\end{align}$$",
					"Donc $P(x)=(x{{eval:-h;+}})^2{{eval:k;+}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"blanks": [
				{
					"requiredForm": {
