			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On complète le carré : $\\left(x{{eval:b/2;+}}\\right)^2={{eval:x^2+b*x+b^2/4}}$, donc ${{eval:x^2+b*x}}=\\left(x{{eval:b/2;+}}\\right)^2-{{eval:b^2/4}}$.",
					"$$\\begin{align}P(x) &= \\left(x{{eval:b/2;+}}\\right)^2-{{eval:b^2/4}}{{eval:c;+}} \\\\ &= \\left(x{{eval:b/2;+}}\\right)^2{{eval:c-b^2/4;+}}\\end{align}$$",
					"Donc $P(x)=\\left(x{{eval:b/2;+}}\\right)^2{{eval:c-b^2/4;+}}$."
				]
			}
		}
